STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → feature off → EmptyView (web withAiFeature → null). NOT a hidden section: when on but no plan
             has been drafted, the friendly empty output renders.
  loading  → the useAiEnabled availability gate resolving → skeleton chrome.
  empty    → ready + idle stream → "No repair plan yet — ask Helix to draft one." Friendly, never blank.
  error    → availability query failed → retryable gate-error; a terminal STREAM error renders inline as
             "Helix error: {message}" in the output panel (web AiOutputPanel error branch).
  ready    → description + "Ask Helix" + output panel (idle / thinking / prose / error).
  stale /  → the orthogonal connection axis → header freshness chip + banner with a one-shot auto-refresh
  offline    on the live→stale transition (offline shows the banner, no auto-refresh).

